
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en-AU">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title><%= pageTitle %></title>
<meta name="description" content="<%= metaDescription %>">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/base.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/mobility.css">
<link rel="icon" href="/images/favicon.ico">
</head>
<body>

<%- include('partials/header') %>

<section>
  <div class="wrap">

    <div class="split-row">
      <div class="split-row__copy" data-reveal>
        <span class="eyebrow">MOBILITY</span>
        <h1>Plans built for how your team works</h1>
        <p>Managing business mobiles shouldn't be complex. We take control of your mobile fleet with complete visibility, cost optimisation, and hands-on local support — right-sized plans for the way your team actually works. Every plan includes fleet visibility and local support as standard — pick the data allowance that suits each role.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn--primary">Schedule an obligation-free chat</a>
      </div>

      <div class="mobility-devices" data-reveal>
        <img src="/images/iphone.webp" alt="iPhone 16" class="mobility-devices__img mobility-devices__img--iphone" loading="lazy">
        <img src="/images/s26.webp" alt="Samsung Galaxy S26" class="mobility-devices__img mobility-devices__img--samsung" loading="lazy">
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="service-cards-grid">

      <article class="service-card">
        <p class="service-card__title">4G / 5G</p>
        <ul class="service-card__list">
          <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> National 4G &amp; 5G coverage</li>
          <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> High-speed data for busy teams</li>
          <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Built on the Telstra Wholesale network</li>
          <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Flexible plans for every role</li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <article class="service-card">
        <p class="service-card__title">IoT</p>
        <ul class="service-card__list">
          <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> SIMs for connected devices &amp; sensors</li>
          <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Centralised fleet management</li>
          <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Scales from 10 to 10,000 devices</li>
          <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Usage alerts &amp; cost control</li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <article class="service-card">
        <p class="service-card__title">Voice and MBB</p>
        <ul class="service-card__list">
          <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Mobile broadband for remote teams</li>
          <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Voice plans with national coverage</li>
          <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Pooled data across the business</li>
          <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Backup connectivity for sites</li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <article class="service-card">
        <p class="service-card__title">MDM</p>
        <ul class="service-card__list">
          <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Remote device enrolment &amp; setup</li>
          <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Security policy enforcement</li>
          <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Remote lock &amp; wipe for lost devices</li>
          <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> App &amp; update management</li>
        </ul>
      </article>

    </div>

    <!-- ---- Available now: hardware ---- -->
    <div id="hardware" class="subsection-head">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">Available now</span>
        <h3>Business-grade hardware, ready to ship</h3>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="coverflow-carousel" id="coverflowCarousel">
      <div class="coverflow-track" id="coverflowTrack">

        <article class="cf-card" data-index="0">
          <div class="cf-card__media">
            <img src="/images/mobility-iphone.webp" alt="iPhone 16" loading="lazy">
          </div>
          <div class="cf-card__body">
            <span class="device-card__tag">In stock</span>
            <p class="device-card__name">iPhone 16</p>
            <p class="device-card__note">128GB &middot; business plans available</p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="cf-card" data-index="1">
          <div class="cf-card__media">
            <img src="/images/mobility-nokia-fastmile.webp" alt="Nokia FastMile 5G" loading="lazy">
          </div>
          <div class="cf-card__body">
            <span class="device-card__tag">In stock</span>
            <p class="device-card__name">Nokia FastMile 5G</p>
            <p class="device-card__note">5G Gateway &middot; business plans available</p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="cf-card" data-index="2">
          <div class="cf-card__media">
            <img src="/images/mobility-samsung.webp" alt="Samsung Galaxy S25" loading="lazy">
          </div>
          <div class="cf-card__body">
            <span class="device-card__tag">In stock</span>
            <p class="device-card__name">Samsung Galaxy S25</p>
            <p class="device-card__note">128GB &middot; business plans available</p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="cf-card" data-index="3">
          <div class="cf-card__media">
            <img src="/images/mobility-tablets.webp" alt="Business Tablets" loading="lazy">
          </div>
          <div class="cf-card__body">
            <span class="device-card__tag">In stock</span>
            <p class="device-card__name">Business Tablets</p>
            <p class="device-card__note">Multiple models &middot; business plans available</p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="cf-card" data-index="4">
          <div class="cf-card__media">
            <img src="/images/mobility-teltonika.webp" alt="Teltonika Router" loading="lazy">
          </div>
          <div class="cf-card__body">
            <span class="device-card__tag">In stock</span>
            <p class="device-card__name">Teltonika Router</p>
            <p class="device-card__note">Enterprise 4G/5G &middot; business plans available</p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="cf-card" data-index="5">
          <div class="cf-card__media">
            <img src="/images/mobility-watch.webp" alt="Smart Watch" loading="lazy">
          </div>
          <div class="cf-card__body">
            <span class="device-card__tag">In stock</span>
            <p class="device-card__name">Smart Watch</p>
            <p class="device-card__note">Connected devices &middot; business plans available</p>
          </div>
        </article>

      </div>

      <button class="cf-arrow cf-arrow--prev" id="cfPrev" aria-label="Previous">
        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M10 2L4 8l6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
      </button>

      <button class="cf-arrow cf-arrow--next" id="cfNext" aria-label="Next">
        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M6 2l6 6-6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
      </button>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>

<script src="/js/main.js" defer></script>
<script src="/js/mobility.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>

